<title>JAPAN: Enplas - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Enplas - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 11.08		vs	   11.89</p>
<p> Operating	  504    million	  vs	  424    million</p>
<p> Current	    782    million	  vs	  568    million</p>
<p> Net		  307    million	  vs	  257    million</p>
<p> EPS		   17.03 yen	  vs	   14.26 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     18 million	  vs	  18 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  7.50 yen	  vs	    7.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Enplas Corp is a top precision processor of engineering plastics.</p>
</text>
